Thyropae is the capital of [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/index|Athrea]], and famed for its maritime trade. It was the seat of the first [[Org/Althane/Council of Althane|Council of Althane]], called there by [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]] after they destroyed [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/The Deep|the Deep]].

